    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated within the exclusive gated Casino development, No. 70 is a superb two-bedroom ground floor apartment offering bright, spacious and well-proportioned accommodation in one of North Dublin's most sought-after coastal locations.\r\n\r\nBeautifully presented throughout, the property briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a generous living and dining room, a fully fitted integrated kitchen, two excellent double bedrooms, with the principal bedroom benefiting from an en suite, and a main bathroom.\r\n\r\nA particular feature of the apartment is its dual east and west-facing aspect, complemented by a west-facing balcony—the perfect spot to unwind and enjoy the afternoon and evening sunshine.\r\n\r\nThe property further benefits from secure resident parking and access to the beautifully maintained communal gardens, set within the mature landscaped grounds of this exclusive development.\r\n\r\nUnrivalled Village Location\r\n\r\nThe Casino enjoys an exceptional position on the Dublin Road, directly adjacent to Malahide DART Station and opposite Malahide Demesne and Cricket Club. Malahide Village is just a short stroll away, offering an outstanding selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques, pubs and local amenities, together with the marina and scenic coastal walks.\r\n\r\nWith its generous accommodation, excellent natural light, private balcony and superb village location, this attractive apartment represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nManagement fee: approximately €3,365 per annum.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
